                                                "sense_id": "1665e807-e229-351c-8a0f-83a0d14bd66d",
                                                "text": "The space behind the door is filled with mojibake, more specifically, a mojibake that is made of pieces of my memory. “Why? Why do I like girls?” I hear a younger voice of mine echoing in the room."
